Read `AGENTS.md` once per task. Stay concise: targeted search and file ranges, minimal diffs, short test logs; no repeated whole-repo scans or full build-file dumps. Work on a branch + PR, never deploy/merge without approval. Keep existing business behavior and roles. Never read/commit customer data or secrets. Do not bypass `protected_carton_state_mismatch` safeguards. Be explicit about unverified results.
